### Describe the bug

Animation is not applied when it is referenced inside global selector which is nested

### Reproduction

[Reproduction](https://svelte-5-preview.vercel.app/#H4sIAAAAAAAAE5VRy27CMBD8FcvqAVQeoafKCaj9DszBcTbBwllH9oaCUP69ckJKUC_tbT3jmVmPb7w0FgIX-xtHVQMX_LNp-ILTtYmHcAZLwBc8uNbriGRBe9PQTqIkC8S0a5HYlr0EUgSzZJ5KjFzZoibjkBnUHmpAms3ZLTKSBs3rlm3iZeokZuuHLWaFObNCkVpWHgD7qB7TVoWwlTx3F8l32bow552kqO6nJ2luW_iXMtDVDopV7i7jql-moKNgmyRpLukAHcFUR5pi3fDkjxNcS69qCCxoZWGp0Iw-pXf1OEvqacGS1fvds5vYiMq6XNnZ_lHBYc6mS-VKnyrvWiwE6_m7i0JTq1i6mCzwFpjB0qAhSH-njJb7n9IOT1HPYZFPR-JPaax7_HBfMF_w2hWmNFBwQb6F7tB9A-RRJwaGAgAA)
```css
         @keyframes scale-ani {
		from {
			scale: 0.8;
		}
	}

	/* Works */
	:global([data-green]) .box {
		background: green;
		animation: scale-ani 2s infinite;
	}

	/* Does not work */
	:global {
		[data-blue] .box {
			background: blue;
			animation: scale-ani 2s infinite;
	 }
	}
```

